00:25:31.390 --> 00:25:33.256
<i>I don't understand...</i>


00:25:35.390 --> 00:25:38.357
<i>how you can have anything to do
with someone like her.</i>


00:25:44.457 --> 00:25:46.090
Just because you
don't understand


00:25:46.123 --> 00:25:48.024
doesn't mean it cannot be.


00:25:49.690 --> 00:25:51.090
<i>But why?</i>


00:25:52.190 --> 00:25:54.256
That's the wrong question.


00:25:54.290 --> 00:25:56.457
The right question is,


00:25:56.490 --> 00:25:58.490
"Is this the way
of the world?"


00:25:58.523 --> 00:26:00.957
And the answer is yes.


00:26:00.990 --> 00:26:02.924
<i>What do you know?</i>


00:26:02.957 --> 00:26:05.523
<i>You don't live in the world.</i>


00:26:05.557 --> 00:26:09.190
<i>You stuck yourself at the
end of the universe in here.</i>


00:26:09.223 --> 00:26:14.357
<i>You can't see your selfishness,
arrogance, and above all, your ignorance.</i>


00:26:14.390 --> 00:26:18.323
<i>You pretend to be
open to all things</i>


00:26:18.357 --> 00:26:23.223
<i>but can't see
how closed-minded you are.</i>


00:26:23.256 --> 00:26:28.123
<i>Do you actually believe
you'll find your soul here?</i>


00:26:28.156 --> 00:26:30.223
My soul is within me.


00:26:32.590 --> 00:26:34.557
<i>Wrong again, brother.</i>


00:26:34.590 --> 00:26:38.290
<i>Your soul is outside of you,
and you must claim it.</i>


00:26:39.423 --> 00:26:40.557
I have.


00:26:42.590 --> 00:26:45.290
I began a journey
that finished here.


00:26:45.323 --> 00:26:47.623
<i>There is no beginning.</i>


00:26:47.657 --> 00:26:50.390
<i>There is no end.
That's babble.</i>


00:26:50.423 --> 00:26:53.490
<i>That's not the language
of the soul.</i>


00:26:53.523 --> 00:26:59.056
<i>Time will pass,
and you'll continue to be lost.</i>


00:27:00.256 --> 00:27:03.056
You sound like my father.


00:27:03.090 --> 00:27:06.490
<i>You complain that your father
didn't know you.</i>


00:27:06.523 --> 00:27:10.190
<i>He carried you on his back
through life,</i>


00:27:10.223 --> 00:27:15.457
<i>and all you can do is criticize
some oversights he committed,</i>


00:27:15.490 --> 00:27:19.023
<i>while you are guilty
of the biggest crimes.</i>


00:27:20.023 --> 00:27:21.423
Really?


00:27:21.457 --> 00:27:23.523
What crimes were those?


00:27:23.557 --> 00:27:25.156
<i>You tell me.</i>


00:27:26.956 --> 00:27:29.423
<i>No, instead you'd like
to hear it from my mouth</i>


00:27:29.457 --> 00:27:32.123
<i>so you can deny it.</i>


00:27:32.156 --> 00:27:36.123
<i>That's the same cowardly game
you played with your father.</i>


00:27:37.123 --> 00:27:38.623
I love my father.


00:27:38.657 --> 00:27:42.323
<i>You were not a loving son.</i>


00:27:42.357 --> 00:27:44.657
<i>You were a burden to him.</i>


00:27:44.691 --> 00:27:46.890
<i>And now to me.</i>


00:29:54.457 --> 00:29:59.658
<i>When I had been pondering many
different things to myself for a long time,</i>


00:29:59.691 --> 00:30:04.558
<i>and had for many days been seeking
my own self and what my own good was,</i>


00:30:04.591 --> 00:30:07.923
<i>and what evil
was to be avoided,</i>


00:30:07.956 --> 00:30:12.490
<i>there suddenly spoke to me...
What was it?</i>


00:30:12.524 --> 00:30:14.889
<i>I myself or someone else?</i>


00:30:14.923 --> 00:30:18.624
<i>Inside or outside me?</i>


00:30:18.658 --> 00:30:23.256
<i>This is the very thing I
would love to know, but don't.</i>


00:30:38.390 --> 00:30:39.856
No.


